[length:04:25]
[ti:One thing right]
[ar:Aracne]
[al:Chaotic-Dysfunctional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:02.23]I’m not talking to heaven...
[00:07.23]I’m talking to you.
[00:12.00]I’m not praying to God.
[00:17.03]I’m praying to the shape you left
[00:21.30]inside my room.
[00:40.60]Wake up, dress up,
[00:42.60]hands shake, mouth shut,
[00:43.65]smile nice, fail twice,
[00:44.93]swallow the rust.
[00:46.25]Clean face, bad head,
[00:47.55]same sheets, wrong bed,
[00:48.81]you left, I stayed,
[00:50.18]now nothing works instead.
[00:51.51]I try to answer
[00:52.61]like a person would,
[00:54.03]I try to eat
[00:55.17]like my body should.
[00:57.08]I try to love
[00:57.95]without breaking the plate,
[00:59.27]but every little thing
[01:00.43]comes out too late.
[01:02.13]Everybody says
[01:03.33]time makes it clean,
[01:04.56]but time is just a hallway
[01:05.85]with your name in the seams.
[01:07.28]Everybody says
[01:08.46]I’ll sleep through the night,
[01:09.95]but the ceiling keeps opening
[01:11.17]its terrible light.
[01:12.80]Why did you leave me
[01:13.97]with the doors open wide?
[01:15.17]Why did you teach me
[01:16.32]how to disappear right?
[01:17.97]I don’t want the exit,
[01:19.23]I don’t want the light,
[01:20.45]I just want to do one thing,
[01:22.23]one thing right.
[01:23.33]Why did you leave me
[01:24.47]where the bad thoughts bite?
[01:25.85]Why did you love me
[01:26.95]then leave me to fight?
[01:28.45]I don’t want the exit,
[01:29.85]I don’t want the light,
[01:31.05]I just want to do one thing,
[01:32.77]one thing right.
[01:38.49]one thing right.
[01:39.46]Sit still, act fine,
[01:40.56]count cracks, count time,
[01:41.91]good girl, bad spine,
[01:43.24]laugh on the line.
[01:44.62]No call, no sign,
[01:45.96]your ghost drinks mine,
[01:47.29]I make little futures
[01:48.49]then watch them decline.
[01:49.94]I kept the curtains
[01:51.21]where you liked them black,
[01:52.89]I kept the silence
[01:53.84]like it still belonged to you.
[01:55.48]I kept your shadow
[01:56.49]in the kitchen drawer,
[01:58.08]now it crawls out laughing
[01:59.23]when I hit the floor.
[02:00.71]Everybody says
[02:01.99]pain has a shape,
[02:03.36]but mine has your hands
[02:04.61]and it wears your face.
[02:06.21]Everybody says
[02:07.24]I’ll learn to survive,
[02:08.58]but there were so many doors
[02:10.04]and they’re beginning to rot.
[02:11.51]I’m doing all the breathing
[02:12.67]like the body is mine,
[02:13.99]but I count every morning
[02:15.28]and I don’t feel alive.
[02:18.58]Why did you leave me
[02:20.00]with the doors open wide?
[02:20.95]Why did you teach me
[02:22.22]how to disappear right?
[02:23.47]I don’t want the exit,
[02:24.91]I don’t want the light,
[02:26.09]I just want to do one thing,
[02:27.24]one thing right.
[02:28.94]Why did you leave me
[02:30.22]where the bad thoughts bite?
[02:31.53]Why did you love me
[02:32.98]then leave me to fight?
[02:34.05]I don’t want the exit,
[02:35.37]I don’t want the light,
[02:36.64]I just want to do one thing,
[02:38.29]one thing right.
[02:45.00]Father? No.
[02:46.33]Lover? Yes.
[02:47.99]I am kneeling
[02:49.05]to your absence.
[02:50.56]Heaven? No.
[02:51.84]Rooted legs? Yes.
[02:53.42]I am praying
[02:54.75]to the dent you left.
[02:56.40]Take this panic,
[02:57.61]take this bed,
[02:59.10]take the future
[03:00.54]from my head.
[03:01.76]Take the doorway,
[03:03.28]take the night,
[03:04.70]leave me one thing,
[03:06.08]one thing right.
[03:11.86]One thing right!
[03:14.62]I stayed alive!
[03:16.61]Isn’t that right?
[03:18.32]One thing right!
[03:23.92]One thing right!
[03:25.33]I stayed alive!
[03:27.41]Isn’t that right?
[03:29.53]Why did you leave me
[03:30.52]with the doors open wide?
[03:31.41]Why did you teach me
[03:32.46]how to disappear right?
[03:33.97]I don’t want the exit,
[03:35.51]I don’t want the light,
[03:36.80]I just want to do one thing,
[03:38.56]one thing right.
[03:39.69]Why did you leave me
[03:40.76]where the bad thoughts bite?
[03:42.22]Why did you love me
[03:43.33]then leave me to fight?
[03:44.89]I don’t want the exit,
[03:46.40]I don’t want the light,
[03:47.65]I just want to do one thing,
[03:49.34]one thing right.
[03:54.48]I’m not talking to heaven...
[03:59.78]I’m talking to you.
[04:07.48]I stayed alive.
[04:11.44]Isn’t that right?
